{"title":"2006 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/5/da5d78b2c9ca7165ec99af98a97f256b5150a40a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n,k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> be the number of ways distributing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> candies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> children so that each child receives at most two candies. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/7/1275ef9b0b4dbf308e5616063dc03bd124b8fcb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3,7)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f43f40798c53a54d60c4b42928a5d973e65e33a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3,6)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/a/45a1b2e87dc25b2d39676dc967fefbe5f5d48b3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3,4)=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" />. Evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/1/4115f42dfd01fb4a1bcc30ff995bb4d0d41dd0f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2006,1)+f(2006,4)+f(2006,7)+\\dots+f(2006,1003)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"449\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/f/f8f98e81dd3b8b734617a60acb6f662418a6a07a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 + \\cdots + x_{2006} = k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/4/424f284bf76384be84bde29fecfcab11292cc32b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i \\in \\{0,1,2\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/3/a63588d48cc9015ddcfc1560cf86e98b33b51972.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\therefore$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> generating function for one student is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/9/6f9e84ffe3f7ba76f072b007e28b283035f0e098.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = (x^0 + x^1 + x^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"174\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>generating function for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> many students is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/f/5ef5f6a762cdb2473456cbdce6b2b27bbd76e579.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)^n = (x^0 + x^1 + x^2)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"192\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/3/a63588d48cc9015ddcfc1560cf86e98b33b51972.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\therefore$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> generating function for 2006 many students is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/e/5ce6ea48bf83c5401771e48437ed9ae76e975859.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^0 + x^1 + x^2)^{2006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"141\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/0/81003a85b95879b2dd7af101f702775620fac3e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x) = (x^0 + x^1 + x^2)^{2006} = (1 + x + x^2)^{2006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"347\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/6/e56975518cace4baa34ad81f935e965e4ebe83d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x) = \\sum_{k=0}^{2 \\cdot 2006} f(2006, k) x^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"198\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/3/be3c6f70bf5e0afd0521fdc77d2b75c77b7fa095.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=0}^{2 \\cdot 2006} f(2006, k) x^k = g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"198\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/3/a63588d48cc9015ddcfc1560cf86e98b33b51972.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\therefore$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/0/0a05e53670b9c81dcb264c131e81bb8a83cc971c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{3k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/2/7728fae45e9e9f97067f0b441a848784fae0597f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2006, 3k+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"20\" />, \\quad <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/1048ccdf92cbf18767e97e5c811005cd8430c76d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\in \\{0,1,\\dots\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/9/4a95a178709e3b48e0c735af084bca6966ef6545.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(x) = g(x) x^{-1} = \\frac{(1 + x + x^2)^{2006}}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"275\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/f/eaf7f9da1ac3958c2988c3cf807fa3c60cb255b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^{1337} f(2006, 3k+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"151\" height=\"56\" /> is the sum of the coefficients of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/5/a157f618008d887b68b00109fc823688ca189265.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{3m},\\ m \\in \\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/7/1f745cf4286f88b236750e1e9a8abe3dacd9dc39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/1/a61a1b66877d5fa9805ee139b1c4bb94c0d849ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega = e^{2\\pi i/3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" /> \\quad (third root of unity)\n</p><p>and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/7/dc71b6edecc4c9cab3c20c312b63dcc0852d3792.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + \\omega + \\omega^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>the other coefficients vanish when we add up\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/4/f440275e89cdb56661e6225ee2a8f08651e6f93e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(\\omega^2) + g(\\omega) + g(1) = \\frac{(1 + \\omega + \\omega^2)^{2006}}{\\omega} + \\frac{(1 + \\omega^2 + \\omega^4)^{2006}}{\\omega^2} + \\frac{3^{2006}}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"534\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/2519189abecc5452c77666075555686c4da9dc76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\frac{3^{2006}}{1} + \\frac{0}{\\omega^2} + \\frac{0}{\\omega} = 3^{2006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"206\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>and since we added up the same coefficient thrice, we need to divide it by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/a/faacb0596e3f50044271873e8c826d563a60016c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\therefore \\sum_{k=1}^{1337} f(2006, 3k+1) = \\frac{3^{2006}}{3} = 3^{2005}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"293\" height=\"56\" />\n~Ishan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Canadian_MO\" title=\"2006 Canadian MO\">2006 Canadian MO</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Canadian_MO\" title=\"2006 Canadian MO\">2006 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"2006 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017211645\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 191/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 721/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 48/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6337/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.670      1 Template:CanadaMO_box\n100.00%    6.670      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4547:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017211645 and revision id 248829. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}